{"title":"Asymptote: Advanced","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Help\" title=\"Asymptote: Help\">Next: Help</a>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote_(Vector_Graphics_Language)\" title=\"Asymptote (Vector Graphics Language)\">Asymptote (Vector Graphics Language)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Getting_Started\" title=\"Asymptote: Getting Started\">Getting&#160;Started</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Basics\" title=\"Asymptote: Basics\">Basics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Drawing\" title=\"Asymptote: Drawing\">Drawing</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Labeling\" title=\"Asymptote: Labeling\"> Labeling</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Filling\" title=\"Asymptote: Filling\"> Filling</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Useful_functions\" title=\"Asymptote: Useful functions\">Useful functions</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Useful_commands_and_their_Output\" title=\"Asymptote: Useful commands and their Output\">Examples</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Macros_and_Packages\" title=\"Asymptote: Macros and Packages\">Macros&#160;and&#160;Packages</a><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Help\" title=\"Asymptote: Help\">Help</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Reference\" title=\"Asymptote: Reference\">Reference</a> - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"> Advanced&#160;Asymptote</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=3D_graphics_for_Asymptote\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"3D graphics for Asymptote\">3D Graphics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_CSE5\" title=\"Asymptote: CSE5\">CSE5 Package</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_How_to\" title=\"Asymptote: How to\">How to</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>These pages cover the more advanced features of Asymptote: advanced configuration options, language features, and Asymptote's ability to be extended through custom functions, macros, and packages.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Advanced_Configuration\" title=\"Asymptote: Advanced Configuration\">Advanced&#160;Configuration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Logical_Operators_and_Loops\" title=\"Asymptote: Logical Operators and Loops\">Logical&#160;Operators&#160;and&#160;Loops</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Macros_and_Packages\" title=\"Asymptote: Macros and Packages\">Macros&#160;and&#160;Packages</a></li></ul>\n<p>Here is a list of every tutorial we've written for Asymptote, as not every one has been included in the box at the top of these pages.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-prefixindex-body\"><ul class=\"mw-prefixindex-list\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_3D_graphics\" title=\"Asymptote: 3D graphics\"> 3D graphics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Advanced\" title=\"Asymptote: Advanced\"> Advanced</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Advanced_Configuration\" title=\"Asymptote: Advanced Configuration\"> Advanced Configuration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Basics\" title=\"Asymptote: Basics\"> Basics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_CSE5\" title=\"Asymptote: CSE5\"> CSE5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Crash_Course\" title=\"Asymptote: Crash Course\"> Crash Course</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Drawing\" title=\"Asymptote: Drawing\"> Drawing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Example_1\" title=\"Asymptote: Example 1\"> Example 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Filling\" title=\"Asymptote: Filling\"> Filling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Getting_Started\" title=\"Asymptote: Getting Started\"> Getting Started</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Getting_Started/Windows/Downloads_and_Installation\" title=\"Asymptote: Getting Started/Windows/Downloads and Installation\"> Getting Started/Windows/Downloads and Installation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Getting_Started/Windows/Interactive_Mode\" title=\"Asymptote: Getting Started/Windows/Interactive Mode\"> Getting Started/Windows/Interactive Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Graphing\" title=\"Asymptote: Graphing\"> Graphing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Help\" title=\"Asymptote: Help\"> Help</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_How_to\" title=\"Asymptote: How to\"> How to</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Labeling\" title=\"Asymptote: Labeling\"> Labeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Logical_Operators_and_Loops\" title=\"Asymptote: Logical Operators and Loops\"> Logical Operators and Loops</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Macintosh\" title=\"Asymptote: Macintosh\"> Macintosh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Macros_and_Packages\" title=\"Asymptote: Macros and Packages\"> Macros and Packages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Marking_Angles\" title=\"Asymptote: Marking Angles\"> Marking Angles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Olympiad_Package_Part_1\" title=\"Asymptote: Olympiad Package Part 1\"> Olympiad Package Part 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Reference\" title=\"Asymptote: Reference\"> Reference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Useful_commands_and_their_Output\" title=\"Asymptote: Useful commands and their Output\"> Useful commands and their Output</a></li>\n<li><a href=\